  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "The fashion of 2000s Yoga Mom is heavily inspired by Y2K trends, primarily the fashion of Zen-X. It is part of a larger Y2K fashion revival that we are currently undergoing in the 2020s.",
    "Tops": "Fitted tank tops, often racer-back; Lightweight zip-up sweatshirts; Halter tops; Baby tees; Sports bras; V-neck and scoop neck necklines; Built-in bras in tank tops",
    "Bottoms": "Low rise yoga pants; Capris; Short shorts; Sweatpants; Fold-over waistbands",
    "Shoes": "Flip-flops and sandals, especially wedge/chunky ones; Sneakers or running shoes",
    "Accessories": "Duffle bags; Large tote bags; Bangles; Chunky sunglasses; Wide headbands; Wired headphones; Discreet watches and health monitors (like FitBits)",
    "Hair, Makeup, and Beauty": "Clean Girl makeup (\"no-makeup look\"); French manicure or nude nails; Hair kept \"simple and sporty\": ponytails, messy buns, or down and pushed back with a wide headband; Clean, fresh scents like bamboo, pear, green tea, rain, and water lotus"
  },
